296
00:19:28.709 --> 00:19:29.918
Alex?

297
00:19:30.627 --> 00:19:33.172
(PANTS)

298
00:19:34.131 --> 00:19:35.549
ALEX:
Mommy.

299
00:19:38.385 --> 00:19:39.803
Alex?

300
00:19:42.306 --> 00:19:46.143
(BABY ALEX CRYING)

301
00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:49.021
